            <mattext texttype="text/plain">A product task focuses on producing a finished, usable result. AI assistance may be appropriate for product tasks, as long as the student reviews the output carefully. An assignment focused on developing a skill is a process task, which is the opposite. Purchasing materials and group collaboration are not part of the definition of a product task in this module.</mattext>
          </material>
