            <mattext texttype="text/plain">The four principles named in the module are develop competence, maintain transparency, preserve agency, and follow course policies. The other options each contain accurate practices from the module, but none of them represent the four named principles. Recognizing these four principles by name and meaning is a foundational expectation for this course.</mattext>
          </material>
