      <itemfeedback ident="79202_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Elder David A. Bednar taught in 2002 that a student who leaves university with knowledge, skills, and a degree but without integrity and honesty has failed. Elder Dieter F. Uchtdorf spoke about the satisfaction that comes from creating something meaningful. President Dallin H. Oaks addressed the spiritual dangers of dependency. President Russell M. Nelson spoke about individual worthiness and total conversion of mind and heart.</mattext>
