            <mattext texttype="text/html">The module states that overusing direct quotation suggests the student is avoiding the deeper work of understanding and restating ideas in their own words. Finding strong evidence, reading widely, and understanding academic writing are all positive behaviors, and not what heavy use of direct quotations indicates. Paraphrasing and summarizing demonstrate genuine comprehension in a way that direct quotation does not.</mattext>
